  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - Regional Business Development Manager: PSC, through U.S. Government - Trade and Development Agency</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This $190,000 obligation funded the second option year of USTDA&apos;s personal services contract with Mr. Jason Nagy, USTDA&apos;s African Business Development Manager. Mr. Nagy&apos;s continued presence in USTDA&apos;s Regional Office in Johannesburg, South Africa helped to ensure the successful continuation of the Agency&apos;s business development, program evaluation, and project management operations across sub-Saharan Africa and in South Africa, in particular.</narrative>
  </description>
